# Only webui/ and server/ are COPYed into the image; everything else is
# mounted at runtime (data/, tools/models) or unrelated — keep the build
# context small (tools/ alone is a multi-GB toolchain).
*
!server/
!webui/
webui/node_modules
webui/dist
webui/tsconfig.app.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
server/.venv
